2009_level2_solutions.pdf,9,b,"January 1980 had exactly 4 Mondays and 4 Fridays. Which day of the week was January 1st?
(a) Monday
(b) Tuesday
(c) Thursday
(d) Saturday
(e) Impossible to determine",": January has 31 days. There are 4 complete weeks, and 3 additional days. If January starts
on Saturday, Sunday or Monday, there is one more Monday at the end of the month. If January starts on
Wednesday, Thursday of Friday, there is one additional Friday at the end of the month. The only day of
the week which will result in 4 Mondays and 4 Fridays is Tuesday.

