angle A. Since the triangle \bigtriangleupBCD is isosceles, the measure of angle
CBD is
also x. Since the triangle \bigtriangleupABC is isosceles, the measure of the angle
BCA
is also y. Finally, since the triangle \bigtriangleupADB is isosceles, the measure of the angle
