2012_MO_L1Sol.pdf,4,,"Daphne starts walking north at a constant rate of 4 mph. Edmund leaves the
same point at the same time and walks east at a constant rate of 3 mph. How long
will it take for the distance between them to be 1 mile?
(a) 5 minutes
(b) 12 minutes
(c) 1
7th of an hour
(d) 7 minutes
(e) none of the above
The answer is: (b)","Let D be the distance Daphne has walked, E the distance Edmund has
