The answer is: (a)","1: Since -n < 0, it follows that x2 + x -n = (x -a)(x + b) where a and b are
positive integers. Thus n = ab and b = 1 + a by expanding the right hand side of the above
equality. Here are the possible choices for a and b:
a: 1 --- 2 ---. . .--- 9 --- 10
b: 2 --- 3 ---. . .--- 10 --- 11
n = ab: 1 \cdot 2 = 2 --- 2 \cdot 3 = 6--- . . . ---9 \cdot 10 = 90 --- 10 \cdot 11 = 110.
