were still present on Tuesday. Similarly, 10% of the 1000 students who were absent
on Monday, or 0.1(1000) = 100 students, were present on Tuesday. The remaining
1000 - 100 = 900 students who were absent on Monday were still absent on Tuesday.
Thus, there were 8100 + 100 = 8200 students present on Tuesday, or
