3
(e) none of the above
The answer is: (c)","1: Since the x-intercepts of f are 2 and 3, f(x) = a(x -2)(x -3). Since
the y-intercept of f is 1, we know f(0) = 1, so a(-2)(-3) = 1 implying a = 1",484aaa
